 "notes": [
  "No starting section posted; the Objective (posted 'OBJECTIVE ISB OPS') and Prepared Defenses (posted in the interrupts) are taken as starting cards. Strategy says to start There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement or Imperial Decree depending on matchup, so no starting effect is set.",
  "Section headers (GREENS2, BLUES8, STICKY REDS11, BIG REDS14) were mis-parsed as cards and removed; IAO (Imperial Arrest Order), missed by the draft, was restored.",
  "Posted 'Bossko', 'dengar' and 'zuckuss' are under BLUES (starships/vehicles), so dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth, Dengar In Punishing One and Zuckuss In Mist Hunter (strategy: 'zuckuss + high forfeit pilot/passengers').",
  "Posted 'YCHFE' dested You Cannot Hide Forever (Effect); the You Cannot Hide Forever & Mobilization Points combo is Reflections III and Mobilization Points is listed separately.",
  "Posted 'TINTOE' dested There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; 'oberk', 'capt. jonus', 'serg. tarl' dested Corporal Oberk, Captain Jonus, Sergeant Tarl; '4-lom EJP' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle (Enhanced Jabba's Palace); 'coruscant' dested the Dark Special Edition printing; 'secret plans' is the Special Edition Effect."
